 "strings": [
  "",
  "Blex",
  "\"...Ngh!",
  " The politicians living on Earth",
  " understand nothing!\"",
  "Quattro",
  "\"Yes. That they would lean toward",
  " handing the Titans command of",
  " the Earth Federation Forces...\"",
  "\"I couldn't believe it.\"",
  "\"Jamitov can look at",
  " the desertification of Africa",
  " and feel nothing at all.\"",
  "\"Is there no way",
  " to ship every last politician",
  " off into space?\"",
  "\"They say space makes them sick.\"",
  "Blex and Quattro",
  "were attending the general",
  "assembly of the Earth Federation",
  "government, held in Dakar.",
  "Blex had",
  "another face as well:",
  "that of a Federation legislator.",
  "The Earth Federation,",
  "for all its talk of civilian control,",
  "did not bar serving officers",
  "from sitting in parliament.",
  "It was a dark legacy born of",
  "the emergency regime Revil set up",
  "during the One Year War.",
  "Since ancient times,",
  "no one has ever taken power",
  "by covert armed struggle alone.",
  "Taking the Federation parliament",
  "would hand the AEUG",
  "the banner of legitimacy.",
  "Jamitov,",
  "decrying the AEUG threat",
  "after Jaburo's destruction,",
  "meant to use the Titans' might",
  "to take hold of",
  "the Federation government.",
  "His threat of a colony drop",
  "on the moon,",
  "though it ended in failure,",
  "still worked in Jamitov's favor.",
  "Of course, not every",
  "legislator was an",
  "Earth supremacist,",
  "so parliament kept seesawing",
  "back and forth.",
  "Then again, Earth supremacists",
  "who believed that if Jamitov",
  "took power, their vested interests",
  "would be at risk",
  "sided with the AEUG,",
  "and it fell to",
  "Blex to win",
  "them over.",
  "But",
  "those moves would be preempted",
  "by Jamitov.",
  "\"L-Lieutenant Quattro...\"",
  "\"Commodore...!\"",
  "Back in his hotel room,",
  "what Quattro found",
  "was Blex, his chest",
  "stained with fresh blood.",
  "It was plainly",
  "an assassination by the Titans.",
  "\"They got me...",
  " Jamitov",
  " got the better of me...\"",
  "\"Stay with me, sir!\"",
  "\"I want you to become the man",
  " who moves the world...\"",
  "\"Commodore...\"",
  "\"You...",
  " take command of the AEUG...\"",
  "\"Char Aznable!\"",
  "\"Commodore Blex!\"",
  "Quattro, however, did not",
  "step at once onto",
  "the main stage of history.",
  "Blex had been, in a sense,",
  "his guardian on Earth, almost",
  "a foster father, and his death,",
  "it is generally held,",
  "deepened Quattro's",
  "sense of futility.",
  "He stayed with the AEUG, but",
  "largely out of a sense of",
  "obligation to the late Blex.",
  "The notion of reform",
  "within the national framework",
  "of the Earth Federation",
  "struck him as",
  "hopelessly unrealistic.",
  "In any case,",
  "with things as they were, Quattro",
  "had no reason to stay on Earth.",
  "Audhumla",
  "Hayato",
  "\"Ah, the Commodore's death--",
  " when you announce it to the AEUG,",
  " mind the timing...\"",
  "\"I know.\"",
  "\"Word has been sent",
  " up to space.\"",
  "\"You can count on",
  " Captain Bright.\"",
  "\"Thank you, Hayato-kun.",
  " I'm in the Audhumla's debt",
  " once again.\"",
  "\"Not at all...\"",
  "\"Now that Commodore Blex",
  " is gone,\"",
  "\"we need you to hold the AEUG",
  " together, Lieutenant Quattro...\"",
  "\"...\"",
  "\"There's one more request.",
  " It's from Mrs. Bright.\"",
  "\"Ah... always so attentive,",
  " Mrs. Mirai Yashima...\"",
  "Children's\n   Recreation",
  "The Alexandria Crew",
  "Children's Recreation",
  "Kamille",
  "\"Fa! What are you doing!\"",
  "Fa",
  "\"At least let me comb my hair.\"",
  "\"The next fight's a tough one,",
  " and with that attitude,",
  " you're no kind of pilot!\"",
  "\"You don't have to start",
  " looking after me all of a sudden.\"",
  "\"Honestly...\"",
  "\"I'll be right there.",
  " I don't want to look at",
  " that sulky face of yours!\"",
  "\"Fine.\"",
  "Haro",
  "\"Fa,",
  " emotion line high! High!\"",
  "\"I know that!\"",
  "Apolly",
  "\"Hey, Kamille! What's up?\"",
  "\"Nothing!\"",
  "\"Recreation's fine, but a boy",
  " wearing a face full of",
  " weird worries is no good.\"",
  "\"It is recreation!\"",
  "\"Just try talking it out.",
  " Lieutenant Quattro's",
  " coming back, you know.\"",
  "\"We can't have him worrying",
  " needlessly",
  " about you, can we!\"",
  "\"Whenever I talk with Fa,",
  " it always turns into a fight.",
  " Why is that?\"",
  "\"That's all it is.\"",
  "\"Well, kid... that's the kind of thing",
  " you only get to fret over young.",
  " So fret away. See ya.\"",
  "\"All big talk and nothing else!\"",
  "\"Hahaha!\"",
  "Torres",
  "\"The Alexandria fleet that",
  " left A Baoa Qu...\"",
  "\"is expected to reach Earth's",
  " geostationary orbit as soon",
  " as we do, or even sooner.\"",
  "Henken",
  "\"Can't we take a detour",
  " to camouflage",
  " what we're after?\"",
  "\"If we do that,",
  " the shuttle carrying",
  " Lieutenant Quattro will have to\"",
  "\"wait in geostationary orbit",
  " longer than necessary.\"",
  "Bright",
  "\"Having to move into enemy space",
  " to receive the laser message",
  " really cost us.\"",
  "\"We'll just have to force our way",
  " through, Captain Bright.\"",
  "\"Sorry I'm late.\"",
  "\"The mobile suit team?\"",
  "\"The Zeta and the Methuss,",
  " but it'd be better",
  " to keep them apart.\"",
  "\"Why?\"",
  "\"It's a pilot problem.\"",
  "\"The pilots...!?\"",
  "Emma",
  "\"Ah, Ensign Reccoa",
  " is off at Granada, isn't she?\"",
  "\"Yes, and so",
  " Kamille and Fa are...\"",
  "\"Recreation again?\"",
  "\"Sigh...\"",
  "\"I don't think I could",
  " ever play father",
  " to Kamille...\"",
  "The Alexandria",
  "descended from the line of",
  "the Musai-class cruiser.",
  "It had a deck that could launch",
  "four mobile suits at once,",
  "and greater firepower",
  "than the Musai's.",
  "Its design had been",
  "under way since before",
  "the Delaz Conflict,",
  "but given its cost,",
  "nearly all were assigned",
  "to the Titans alone.",
  "Soldier",
  "\"Lieutenant Jerid,",
  " urgent call",
  " from the mobile suit deck!\"",
  "Jerid",
  "\"What!?\"",
  "\"What is it...?\"",
  "\"...What? I'll be right there.\"",
  "Mouar",
  "\"What's wrong?\"",
  "\"It's Yazan...!",
  " I'll be back in a bit.\"",
  "Yazan Gable was a man",
  "who had come to the Titans",
  "from the Earth Federation Forces.",
  "Word was he'd hit even a superior",
  "if he didn't like the man.",
  "He was a beast of a man.",
  "Yet perhaps his candor, never",
  "reining in his fighting instinct,",
  "sat well with Scirocco, for no",
  "sooner had he joined the Titans",
  "than he was given command",
  "of an MS squadron.",
  "Such a man could hardly",
  "see eye to eye with Jerid,",
  "a Titans man born and bred.",
  "Mechanic",
  "\"He says he'll toss the Hizack",
  " out by force if he has to.\"",
  "\"Damn that Yazan!",
  " What's he doing!\"",
  "Sarah",
  "\"Jerid!",
  " Please stop, Captain Yazan!\"",
  "Yazan",
  "\"I can't stand the thought of",
  " fighting in this piece of junk!\"",
  "\"Lieutenant Jerid.\"",
  "\"Outta the way!\"",
  "\"Get out of that cockpit!\"",
  "\"Hmph! Can't even die right.\"",
  "\"If you won't listen,",
  " I'll throw you in for treason.\"",
  "\"Quit your yapping!\"",
  "\"Why are you doing this!\"",
  "\"On any ship I ride, I don't want",
  " obsolete dolls, or half-baked",
  " combat dolls like that one!\"",
  "\"I'm a combat doll?\"",
  "\"Well, aren't you?\"",
  "\"Yazan!\"",
  "\"Jerid...!\"",
  "\"Got complaints?",
  " Beat the Zeta Gundam",
  " first, then talk!\"",
  "\"Then maybe I'll listen!\"",
  "\"I'll hold you to that, hear me?\"",
  "\"A real man keeps his word!\"",
  "\"Hahaha!\"",
  "\"Ugh! You bastard!\"",
  "\"Jerid!\"",
  "\"Knock yourself out",
  " with that Cyber-Newtype",
  " thing of yours.\"",
  "\"Stop it, Sarah!",
  " You check the connections",
  " on this Hizack.\"",
  "\"That job",
  " can't be finished yet.\"",
  "\"Yazan",
  " insulted me.\"",
  "\"If it stings, fight!",
  " The only ones called right",
  " are those who fight and survive!\"",
  "\"Do you think so...?\"",
  "\"Hahahaha...\"",
  "\"He said I'm",
  " an incomplete human being.\"",
  "\"Anyone who says that of others",
  " isn't a grown-up himself.\"",
  "\"......\"",
  "\"Hurry!\"",
  "\"Yes...\"",
  "Jerid Messa was not a bad man.",
  "He was a fair, kind, good soldier,",
  "burning with a sense of duty.",
  "That was exactly why he obeyed",
  "orders even as he hesitated,",
  "and kept sending things",
  "from bad to worse.",
  "The same went for Sarah;",
  "it was this misplaced earnestness",
  "that Yazan mocked, though",
  "that was not something",
  "the two young people could see.",
  "On paper they may have been",
  "model students, but they had little",
  "experience of life.",
  "To Jerid,",
  "the Titans were a tool",
  "for realizing his ambitions.",
  "But he wanted them",
  "to be a decent tool.",
  "With would-be bandits like Yazan",
  "and charlatans like Scirocco",
  "scurrying about, these Titans",
  "were not a force he cared",
  "to rule over.",
  "\"The truth is, Scirocco",
  " invited me to come",
  " to the Jupitris.\"",
  "\"Never mind what's behind you.\"",
  "\"If we break through the situation",
  " right in front of us, someday",
  " what's behind it will change too.\"",
  "\"Jerid...!",
  " I was glad when the Alexandria",
  " sent for me.\"",
  "\"Because I knew",
  " you would be",
  " here...\"",
  "\"...Mouar...\"",
  "\"This time,",
  " it's as if you were the one",
  " leading me by the hand.\"",
  "\"Scirocco is a man",
  " whose thoughts",
  " no one can read.\"",
  "\"One moment he seems gentle,",
  " and the next his eyes turn cruel",
  " enough to make your skin crawl.\"",
  "\"I sense the same thing",
  " in that Sarah woman, but\"",
  "\"Scirocco is something",
  " far worse than that...\"",
  "\"He isn't human.\"",
  "\"All right.",
  " You don't have to say any more.\"",
  "Aboard the Argama",
  "\"Fa! Hey, Fa!\"",
  "\"I was wrong earlier.",
  " I know that!\"",
  " We can't afford to be at",
  " each other's throats anymore.\"",
  "\"Any of us could die",
  " at any moment now.\"",
  "\"I'm sure I'm in the wrong",
  " sometimes too, and I'll",
  " apologize as much as it takes.\"",
  "\"But you're leaning on me",
  " a little too much too, Fa...\"",
  "\"We're neither of us",
  " kids anymore...\"",
  "\"I know,",
  " Kamille...\"",
  "\"Playing father to Kamille",
  " and the rest seems beyond me.\"",
  "\"Kamille doesn't need",
  " a father figure anymore.\"",
  "To Bright, Quattro handed over",
  "the envelope Hayato had given him.",
  "\"From your own children.\"",
  "\"Th-thank you...",
  " Nothing could make me happier.\""
 ]
